        "raw": "<p>Ra&#39;s card comes into play that says all hero damage is fire, and all fire damage is +1.</p><p>Pike Industrial&#39;s card comes into play that says all damage is toxic, all damage +1.</p><p>Resolving them in play order, do we:</p><p>A) hero does 2 whatever damage, Ra converts it to fire and gives it +1, then PI turns it toxic and gives it an additional +1 for 4 damage, or...</p><p>B) hero does 2 damage, Ra converts it to fire, it gets +1 for being fire but then loses the +1 when PI turns it to toxic, then gets +1 for the PI card&#39;s global modifier, for 3 damage?</p><p>I&#39;m not married to either answer, both seem right, but my gut says B. &nbsp;What says the group?</p>",
